ttps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369580/extras/6b25427572d41cbdd8b9f51b6ea30f26.webm?t=1783457915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369580/extras/6b25427572d41cbdd8b9f51b6ea30f26.mp4?t=1783457915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369580/extras/579ebdf8ae5809b712138d0d86385cdd.avif?t=1783457915\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing inspiration from beloved classics, we've crafted a beat'em'up experience that combines old-school controls and retro feelings with innovative 3D mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 4 playable characters comes with their signature combat styles, customizable stats that impact gameplay, and detailed backstories to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369580/extras/a7008fce75305c9dce0aaeced1a04014.poster.avif?t=1783457915\" width=720 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369580/extras/a7008fce75305c9dce0aaeced1a04014.webm?t=1783457915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369580/extras/a7008fce75305c9dce0aaeced1a04014.mp4?t=1783457915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique, with randomized elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2369580/extras/bab60b54e4331832335bb63f64901c59.poster.avif?t=178345791